<view class="page"><view class="panel"><text class="title">店铺绩效</text><text class="sub">服务、评分和经营风险概览。</text><view class="health-row"><text>店铺评分</text><text>{{metrics.rating}}</text></view><view class="health-row"><text>及时响应率</text><text>{{service.responseRate}}%</text></view><view class="health-row"><text>订单解决率</text><text>{{service.resolutionRate}}%</text></view><view class="health-row"><text>ACOS</text><text>{{metrics.acos}}%</text></view><text class="review">建议：响应率低于90%时，优先处理待回复订单；ACOS高于30%时，检查广告预算。</text><button bindtap="onBack">返回店铺</button></view></view>